    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald present this extended 3 bed, 2 bath semi-detached with renovations including wrap around insulation, gas fired central heating system, uPVC double glazed windows and composite front door. \n\nAccommodation briefly comprises; porch, hall, livingroom, kitchen / diningroom, family room and shower room. Upstairs there are 3 bedrooms and a bathroom.\n\nLocation is excellent, set in a cul de sac of the popular Donahies development close to all local amenities including schools, shops, church, greens, sports & leisure facilities. Plus, excellent public transport links with both bus and train to & from Dublin City Centre."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nPorch - 1.80m x 0.60m\nSliding Door, Tiled Floor.\n\nHall - 1.80m x 3.65m\nComposite Front Door, Under Stairs Storage Space.\n\nLiving Room - 3.40m x 4.10m\nLaminated Timber Effect Floor, Gas Fire, TV Point, French Doors To......\n\nKitchen/Dining Room - 5.30m x 3.50m\nFitted Kitchen, Oven, Gas Hob, Extractor Fan, Plumbed For Washing Machine And Dishwasher, Part Tiled Floor, Part Lamiated Timber Effect Floor, French Doors To....\n\nFamily Room - 4.30m x 3.75m\nLaminated Timber Effect Floor, Recess Lights, French Doors Out To Rear Garden.\n\nShower Room - 2.60m x 1.95m\nWHB, WC, Corner Electric Shower.\n\n1st Floor - \n\n\nLanding - 1.45m x 2.80m\nHot Press, Access To Attic.\n\nBedroom 1 (Rear) - 3.20m x 2.9m\nBuilt -In Wardrobes, , Laminated Timber Effect Floor, TV Point.\n\nBedroom 2 (Front) - 2.75m x 4.35m\nLaminated Timber Effect Floor.\n\nBedroom 3 (Front) - 2.40m x 2.80m\nLaminated Timber Effect Floor.\n\nBathroom - 1.95m x 1.90m\nWHB, WC, Bath, Part Tiled Walls.\n\nOutside - \n\n\nFront Garden - \nWalled, Off Street Parking for 2 Cars, Flower Bed, Gated Side Entrance.\n\nRear Garden - \nPart Walled, Part Fenced, Deck Patio, Shed, Out Door Light, Out Door Tap.\n\n"
      },
